# Get all stores

Returns an array of of `store` objects that contains
all stores within the API.

Base endpoint:

```shell
{server_url}/stores
```

## Parameters

None.

## Request headers

| Header | Value | Required |
| ------ | ----- | -------- |
| `Accept` | `application/json` | No |

## Request body

None.

## Response Body

```json
    {
    "id": "st_101",
    "name": "SliceOrder Capitol Hill",
    "address": {
      "line1": "1420 E Pine St",
      "city": "Seattle",
      "state": "WA",
      "zip": "98122"
    },
    "order_types": [
      "pickup",
      "delivery"
    ],
    "delivery_fee": 2,
    "hours": {
      "open": "11:00",
      "close": "22:00"
    },
    "timezone": "America/Los_Angeles",
    "open_now": true
  }
```

